    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 091 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(What do I do in the morning?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Every day I usually follow the same schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I get up at six o’clock every morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I clean my room, and then I go jogging with my dog named Happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I run to and from the playground five times."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After I finish jogging, I take a shower."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I have breakfast around 7:30a.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After breakfast, I brush my teeth,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and I leave for school at about eight o’clock."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I often meet my friends and play around a little in the schoolyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "before we go to class."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I have four morning classes that start at nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Each class is about forty-five minutes long."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
    },
